### INSTRUCTIONS ###

1) Move the BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY directory into the USER Module directory.

2) Move the included 05_BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY.sh script into the USER Module directory.
	- Up one level from the BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY directory

Notes:
- The module will be active on the next reboot or re-run of Station Setup. You may re-number it if necessary for your ordering preferences.

- To deactivate the module, place the 05_BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY.sh script back inside the BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY directory and reboot.

- In multi-user installations, BAND-CONDITIONS-CONKY will remain configured for a previous user, if the next user does not also use this module.
